title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The check finishes and is saved
route: /authorizations/eligibility/verify
intro: When the last step ticks, the demo saves the check as a verification record, then opens the result. A patient already on the list gets the record refreshed. Anyone else is added as a new check at the site in view. Scripted answers keep it predictable. If Verify is paused in Settings nothing could be asked, and the check is saved as 'Not checked'.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: answers are scripted from the member ID and the plan. A known patient keeps the verdict it already had. The record is the same one New case reads and writes.
---
start s1 "Last step ticks, banner 'All answers are in. Opening the result.'"
wait w1 "Half a second"
decision qp "Is Verify paused in Settings?"
decision q1 "Opened from a case that is a row on the list?"
decision q2 "Sample card: Summit, Residential 3.5, member ID ending 4821?"
store st1 "Existing record updated\n'Checked just now', its re-check time cleared, date of service as typed"
process p1 "The sample card matches J.M., case R-1042"
process p2 "Answers are not asked again\nThe row keeps its verdict"

group gPaused "Verify is paused"
  store sp1 "Known patient: the last result is kept with the warning\n'Verification service unavailable', check time unchanged"
  store sp2 "Anyone else: a new check with no answers\nEligibility, benefits and authorization 'Not checked'\nWarning 'Verification service unavailable'"
  process sp3 "Headline 'Could not verify: Verify is paused in Settings.'\nButtons 'Open Settings' and 'Check again'"
endgroup

group gNew "A new patient"
  process n1 "Check gets the next ID: V-1001, V-1002 ...\nThe ID is picked so it belongs to the site in view\n(Site A when both are in view). Initials and age only if known from a referral or a case"
  process n2 "Member ID kept as '…1234' (last four)\nScripted answers from the member ID and plan"
  decision n3 "Which scripted answer?"
  process n4 "ID ends 1012\nEligibility 'Lapsed 10/12'"
  process n5 "ID ends 9999\nEligibility 'Not found'"
  process n6 "Evergreen with Detox\nClinic not enrolled"
  process n7 "Beacon with IOP or PHP\nAuthorization 'Not required'"
  process n8 "Harborview with PHP\nBenefits 'Limited'"
  process n10 "ID ends 3030\nBenefits 'Not covered', authorization 'Not required'"
  process n11 "ID ends 6060\nAnother plan found: it pays first"
  process n12 "ID ends 9090\nAuthorization 'On file' with every day or unit used\nfor example '14 of 14 days'"
  process n13 "ID ends 7070\nCoverage ended 09/30, the member is with another plan since 10/01"
  process n14 "ID ends 8080\nCoverage active, but the plan has the member under another ID"
  process n15 "ID ends 5050\nCoverage active, the service was not confirmed"
  process n16 "ID ends 4040\nThe clinic's enrollment could not be confirmed"
  process n17 "ID ends 2020\nNo rule on file for the authorization"
  process n9 "Anything else\nActive, covered, authorization 'Required'"
  store st2 "New verification record added for the site in view\nIt is a row at once on the Eligibility list"
endgroup

process p3 "List counts, tiles and sidebar badge recompute from the records inside the site view"
process p7 "Counts, tiles and badge stay as they were\nOnly the check time and date of service changed"
decision q3 "Is the verdict 'Cleared to bill'?"
process p4 "Badge unchanged"
process p5 "Badge goes up by one"
process p6 "Opens /authorizations/eligibility/V-1001\nor the existing case ID\nIf the check began from a referral, ?referral= (and ?case=) go along, so the result has its back link"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › What the page shows"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The shared verification record"

s1 --> w1 --> qp
qp -->|Yes, known patient| sp1 --> sp3
qp -->|Yes, anyone else| sp2 --> sp3
qp -->|No| q1
sp3 --> p6
q1 -->|Yes| st1
q1 -->|No| q2
q2 -->|Yes| p1 --> st1
q2 -->|No| n1 --> n2 --> n3
st1 --> p2 --> p7 --> p6
n3 -->|Lapsed| n4 --> st2
n3 -->|Not found| n5 --> st2
n3 -->|Not enrolled| n6 --> st2
n3 -->|No authorization| n7 --> st2
n3 -->|Limited| n8 --> st2
n3 -->|Not covered| n10 --> st2
n3 -->|Other plan| n11 --> st2
n3 -->|Limit reached| n12 --> st2
n3 -->|Payer changed| n13 --> st2
n3 -->|ID mismatch| n14 --> st2
n3 -->|Benefit not confirmed| n15 --> st2
n3 -->|Provider not confirmed| n16 --> st2
n3 -->|Requirement unknown| n17 --> st2
n3 -->|Otherwise| n9 --> st2
st2 --> p3
p3 --> q3
q3 -->|Yes| p4 --> p6
q3 -->|No| p5 --> p6
p6 --> g1
st2 -.-> g2
